You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户，订阅模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">广告定价能随算法变准持续上涨、不影响用户留存；订阅涨价一旦引发流失就晚了——这正是奈飞参与度下滑、广告营收目标又没达标时真正该慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飞</span><span class=\"tag\">广告变现</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Forgotten Godmother of Economic Literature Edgeworth box marginalists labor theory of value DSGE racked rent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-oddlots-比简-奥斯汀还畅销的她-因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>比简·奥斯汀还畅销的她，因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的小说比《国富论》原著好读得多，却因为教育意味太浓，在简·奥斯汀式自然主义叙事兴起后被读者和经济学史一起抛弃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">经济思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">女性经济学家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地产逻辑，为什么成就了阿那亚｜钦文对话马寅\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路，不是战略远见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马寅说如果2012年还能像别的开发商一样快进快出赚快钱，他绝不会死磕阿那亚——是十亿贷款和只剩这一个项目的绝境，逼出了这套反地产逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长期主义</span><span class=\"tag\">社区运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定义个人电脑，老黄到底凭什么？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片没变，英伟达要的不是性能而是PC定义权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这颗芯片几乎就是去年发布的DGX Spark换了操作系统，老黄真正想要的不是跑分赢家，而是把CPU、GPU、内存、系统捆成一套只认英伟达规则的PC新架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Compute Comes in Rectangles — Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO BYOC Neoclouds spot capacity FDE MFU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-gpu-稀缺的真正病根-算力只能整块按三年期打包购买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7cf8550aeeab084a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>GPU 稀缺的真正病根：算力只能整块按三年期打包购买</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说，GPU 短缺最大的问题不是抢不到卡，而是几乎所有产能都打包成三到六个月后交付的三年期合约出售，这和大多数客户真实的忽高忽低的需求完全对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力采购</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU稀缺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Here’s Why Experts Keep Being Wrong About the Future radical uncertainty hindsight bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-goodfight-预测失败不是数据问题-是未来本身不可知/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>预测失败不是数据问题，是未来本身不可知</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">手握数据、模型和算力的专家照样在2008年集体失算，因为未来不是等信息补全的拼图，而是一张还没画出来的空白画布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不确定性</span><span class=\"tag\">预测失误</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Frontier Ideas a16z Wants to Fund | Marc Andreessen, Ben Horowitz &amp; Chris Dixon reward hacking outer planets the covenant swarm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-a16z-创业时代变了-该问的不是太疯狂-而是够不够疯狂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89623e03df420598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>创业时代变了：该问的不是太疯狂，而是够不够疯狂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">早期用AI的人和普通机构之间的认知差距，是Marc Andreessen职业生涯里见过最大的一次，而且还在变宽——这意味着中规中矩的产品方案注定不会有差异化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">a16z</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Stand Out In A World Of AI Designs MCP vibe coding / vibe-coded decacorn\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-ycsp-百亿美元公司从不做滚动劫持-ai建的站却总爱这么做/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/994d5c99c317053d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">47:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>百亿美元公司从不做滚动劫持，AI建的站却总爱这么做</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">滚动劫持打断用户已经熟悉的滚动节奏，精度一错位就惹人烦；百亿美元公司官网从不这么干，这反而成了识别AI随手建站的信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI设计工具</span><span class=\"tag\">创业网站</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What will computer chips look like in 2045? EUV High-NA EUV Gate-all-around (GAA) CFET Backside power Hybrid bonding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-dwarkesh-就算无限砸钱-先进芯片产能也只能翻倍-不是十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21bf8bafac799fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>就算无限砸钱，先进芯片产能也只能翻倍，不是十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英特尔CTO说，哪怕拿出无限资本开支，现有全球芯片制造设备存量也只能让先进制程晶圆产能翻一倍——而AI算力需求过去十年每年增长三倍，缺口只会越拉越大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体制造</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片产能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Recommendation Engine for Commodity Traders — Anekha Sokhal, Moshi RecSys MORSE Fulbright Scholarship ICLR Vision Language Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博-而是交易员的推荐系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5deeb7411e2beff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博，而是交易员的推荐系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人把公司定位为彭博、Claude和Netflix的结合体：价值不在给交易员更多数据，而在于像Netflix一样主动推送他们自己想不到该看的二阶关联信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Apex Predator: CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz on Adversaries Armed With AI Agents pyramid of pain breakout time ablated models digital twin distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-nopriors-ai抹平攻击门槛-脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad8f4d231b5e5ea8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>AI抹平攻击门槛：脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源大模型装在家用电脑上就能造勒索软件，入侵后平均29分钟、最快27秒就能在系统里横向移动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Leveraged ETFs Really Work (Marco Sammon &amp; Chris Murray) | #432 convexity bonus volatility drag break-even return swap expected log wealth\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-rationalreminder-3倍杠杆etf跑赢正股-标的股票得先涨170/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>3倍杠杆ETF跑赢正股，标的股票得先涨170%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杠杆ETF每天只盯日收益、不盯年化倍数：日波动5%的标的，3倍产品要涨170%才能反超正股本身——门槛随波动率指数级跳升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率损耗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bhaskar Sunkara Thinks the Market Has a Place Under Socialism market socialism soft budget constraint benchmark wage DSA Rawlsian liberalism labor-managed firm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-oddlots-激进版社会主义-土地全部公有-但房租仍由市场决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>激进版社会主义：土地全部公有，但房租仍由市场决定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他主张，社会主义不必靠配给：把土地和住房全部收归公有后，仍可以保留按市场定价的租金和搬迁自由，用价格而不是配给来分配空间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市场社会主义</span><span class=\"tag\">工人所有制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The dramatic race to discover Insulin Ebers papyrus ligate islets intersecretion theory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-throughline-胰岛素救命的秘方-源自一个失败医生失眠夜写下的25个词/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4970x4970+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffd%2F78%2Fc52487db40188bbe5c7b3c988848%2F9d3ebf18-8ca2-4f49-b2a8-c589b344ae0c.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">37:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>胰岛素救命的秘方，源自一个失败医生失眠夜写下的25个词</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">班廷本是四个月等不到一个病人的失败医生，一次失眠把讲义和论文拼成25个词，又瞒着同事抢先在垂死男孩身上做人体实验，才在伦理真空里抢出了胰岛素。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">胰岛素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The charity that is also a time machine donor-advised fund (DAF) Schedule B chimera\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-complexsys-美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器-减税现在拿-捐钱以后再说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b98a243f0a884fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">27:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器：减税现在拿，捐钱以后再说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这是一套合法的「慈善时间机器」：把钱存进去立刻减税，捐给谁、何时捐可以往后拖很多年——Anthropic员工未来的巨额捐款很可能就走这条路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">慈善</span><span class=\"tag\">税务</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of Constantinople Tetrarchy Solidus Milion Notitia Hippodrome\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-ancients-罗马城早被废弃-君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83ea79d083d093bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>罗马城早被废弃，君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴克里先以来，米兰、尼科米底亚、特里尔早已分走罗马的权力和宫廷；君士坦丁只是把这套迁都惯例做大、做永久，并冠上自己的名字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Myths vs Reality of Mummification natron mummia Fayum portraits unrolling party\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-historyhit-木乃伊制作不是为了保存遗体-而是要把死者变成神/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb07692a6c393b9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>木乃伊制作不是为了保存遗体，而是要把死者变成神</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">策展人坎贝尔·普莱斯说，裹尸、涂树脂、画金边这些工序，目标是把尸体改造成神像，而非留住死者生前的容貌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">木乃伊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"从2亿到40亿，接班人如何重塑洁丽雅？｜钦文对话石晶 特劳特理论\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-wangqinwen-洁丽雅接班人放弃百亿目标-规模做到又能怎么样/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>洁丽雅接班人放弃百亿目标：规模做到又能怎么样</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年前他喊出三年破百亿的目标，如今却说规模做到头也没意义，他要的是一个能活一百年、持续健康增长的品牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企业</span><span class=\"tag\">二代接班</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Arvind Krishna &amp; Nikesh Arora: Quantum Threat, Open vs Frontier AI, AI Cyber Warfare &amp; SaaS Collapse QBI (Quantum Benchmarking Initiative) logical qubit post-quantum cryptography ZDR (zero data retention) open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-allin-加密硬盘现在被偷-五年后也可能被量子计算机破解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2252b98cbb7fdf85-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>加密硬盘现在被偷，五年后也可能被量子计算机破解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">IBM和Palo Alto Networks的CEO说，量子计算机预计2030年前后就能破解今天的加密算法，而后量子密码学方案早已现成，只是企业一直懒得换。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">密码学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"716. King Arthur: The Truth Behind the Legend (Part 4) Historia Britonum dux bellorum Annales Cambriae Mirabilia Britanniae Y Gododdin cataphract\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-restishistory-亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪-这是他存在的最强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c546eadef77e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪，这是他存在的最强证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现存证据没有一条能单独证明亚瑟真实存在，但「亚瑟」作为罗马人名只在不列颠贵族间流行过六七世纪这一小段时间，这个空窗至今无人能解释。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">史源考据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"406. Norman Conquest: The First Crusade (Part 6) Varangian Guard Gesta Francorum liege man\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-empirehist-拜占庭皇帝求援换来十字军-却也换来博希蒙德的个人造神运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>拜占庭皇帝求援换来十字军，却也换来博希蒙德的个人造神运动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿莱克修斯向西方求援引发了第一次十字军东征，但真正借势上位的是假死脱身、靠畅销书包装自己的诺曼人博希蒙德，拜占庭的名誉却成了这场交易的代价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">十字军东征</span><span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Can Dividend Investing Give You Yield AND Growth? yield trap free cash flow payout ratio net share issuance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-mastersinbiz-股息不是收益率游戏-是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5dd15b785a2d85d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>股息不是收益率游戏，是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">股息是现金，骗不了人；作者用自己在金融危机前以51美元卖出花旗的真实交易，说明高股息率常常是价格暴跌的假象，而非公司变好的信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">股息投资</span><span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span>\n</div></div></a>"]